## Assessment initiate notification for Initiator
## $assessment - EdsAssessment
## $date - current date

<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
</head><body><p>Dear $employeeAssessment.assessment.reviewer.getName(),</p>
<p>Please be advised that an employee appraisal has been initiated for $employeeAssessment.employee.getName() on $date and an email notification has also been sent to the employee informing them about the appraisal.</p>
<p>The employee will need to review the appraisal and return it to you. Once your employee completes the self review you will receive a review notification and can review and rate the employee.</p>
<p>The PDF version of the employee appraisal is attached for your attention.</p>
</body></html>